msgid ""
"``fid`` keys the leg in ``file_upload_progress`` and is what "
"``/pause_trans`` / ``/start_trans`` (or `pause_trans` / `start_trans`) "
"addresses; ``peer`` is the transfer's original receiver and "
"``resume_offset`` continues an interrupted file from the byte the "
"receiver already holds."
